  "interpretation": "interior_fraction is the share of Grad-CAM mass inside the annotated lesion; lesion_area_fraction is the lesion's share of the frame, and concentration_ratio is their quotient. A ratio near 1 means the map is no more concentrated on the lesion than area alone would predict. This is a supporting qualitative check and carries no causal claim -- for a misclassified image the map is taken with respect to the predicted class, so landing on the lesion is close to automatic."
